{
  "name": "05 · Project Done → Feedback Form → Reviews or Save-the-Client",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn happy clients into reviews, catch unhappy ones early\nPOST `{\"client_name\":\"Jane\",\"client_email\":\"jane@acme.com\",\"project\":\"Website redesign\"}`\n\n1. Client gets an email with a 2-question form (rating + comment) — built into Gmail *send & wait*\n2. 4–5★ → thank-you + your review link + referral ask\n3. ≤3★ → Claude drafts a recovery email in your Gmail drafts + alerts you\n4. Everything logged to **Feedback** sheet. Waits up to 14 days.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "25092ade-325b-4b96-a8fe-d76fa12e97ee",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -380
      ]
    },
